WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
I don't want you to know

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:04,200
I just want to make up for my own psychological shortcomings

3
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,720
Will know what I did wrong

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,480
I don’t want you to stop wanting me after you find out

5
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:09,920
But brother Shen Ji

6
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,680
Can you trust me a little bit?

7
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,680
I will also be an actor in the future

8
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:14,800
Can shoot steadily

9
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:16,920
Will play tricks with investors

10
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:19,320
You can't forgive me if this happens

11
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:21,320
So how far can we go?

12
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,480
You don't need to be like that, I can support you

13
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,860
But being raised by someone is not what I want at all.

14
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,700
Be beautiful, brave and smart

15
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:29,460
I can obviously have better career development

16
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:31,380
I can prove that I'm as good as you

17
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:34,700
The kind of life you mentioned is not the life I want if you love me

18
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:36,100
Shouldn't you respect me?

19
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:38,860
The director I talked to you about last time

20
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,620
Will attend a dinner party on the weekend

21
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:43,140
The invitation is ready for you

22
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:46,100
What about school?

23
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:50,760
Jingyi, you are still too naive

24
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:52,760
That's why I was fooled around
